# Earthrumbler (Crew 3, vigilance, trample, 7/6): cast on turn 1 with Black Lotus, Mox Emerald and Mox Jet. On turn 3 a Memnite
# (power 1) alone cannot crew it (CR 702.122a); a Grizzly Bears (power 2) alone could not either, but together they tap for total power 3 and
# Earthrumbler becomes an artifact creature.
# It attacks: Bot2's Memnite chump blocks, trample assigns 1 to it and 6 to Bot2 (14), and vigilance leaves Earthrumbler untapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Earthrumbler
Memnite
Grizzly Bears
Island
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Earthrumbler.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Earthrumbler.Activate(Ability: Crew)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Earthrumbler.Power = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Earthrumbler.Activate(Ability: Crew)
! Bot1.Choose(Grizzly Bears)
! Bot1.Choose(Memnite)
Bot1.Choose(Memnite; Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Earthrumbler.Power = 7
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Tapped = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Tapped = true
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Earthrumbler > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Memnite > Earthrumbler)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 14
Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Earthrumbler.Tapped = false
